<title>UK: Visual Action buys US firm for 8.5 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Visual Action buys US firm for 8.5 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Visual Action Holdings Plc said on Tuesday it had bought Chicago-based S&amp;S Holdings, which hires audio-visual equipment, for 8.5 million stg, adding the purchase would be earnings-enhancing in the current year and afterwards.</p>
<p>Visual Action placed 4.1 million new shares at 210 pence per share to finance the acquisition.</p>
<p>S&amp;S's pre-tax profit for the year to May 31 was $2.08 million on turnover of $23.34 million.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
